  "bodyHash": "c02f269043ed232d",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1354/230/casually-swimming.gif\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組將這種具侵略性的水下生物——公牛鯊加入了遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它們出沒於溫暖的海洋、溫和的海洋與河流中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它們相當罕見，但一旦遇上，你會更加珍惜自己的生命。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這些獵手不會放過目標，直到大快朵頤滿足其龐大的食慾，並在原地留下一灘血水後才會離開。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它擁有一條隱藏的飢餓值條。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因此會隨著時間逐漸感到飢餓。（完全飢餓需 5 分鐘）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以手動餵食來恢復它的飢餓值，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">或者當它在水中撿食掉落的肉類或魚類物品時，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">亦或是咬傷他人時也會恢復。（每次恢復 30 秒的飢餓值）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">對它造成傷害會讓它的飢餓值瞬間歸零，並進入狂暴狀態！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">生成時，其初始飢餓值會在 0 到 5 分鐘之間隨機設定，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因此你有機率會遇到已經非常飢餓的個體。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">擁有三種行為模式！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這將決定它如何對待選定的獵物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">好奇：（速度較慢，飢餓值高於 3 分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">有時它會咬附近的人一口，這能恢復 30 秒的飢餓值，且不會繼續追擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">飢餓：（正常速度，飢餓值降至 3 分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">會尋找附近最小的目標進行攻擊，直到飢餓值恢復為止。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">兇猛：（速度極快，飢餓值降至 1 分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">當處於極度飢餓或受到攻擊時，它會尋找獵物，在飢餓值恢復前，會透過撕咬和衝撞攻擊一切目標。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">當獵物倒地後，它便會停止攻擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在尋找獵物時，它會優先鎖定掉落物而非活體目標，因此若它尚未鎖定你，你仍有機會逃脫！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">對了，當它咬住東西時，也會稍微恢復自身生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在 Forge 版中，你可以透過編輯 `data` -> `biome tags` 與 `biome modifier` 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，或使用資源包來調整此項及其他生成設定；Fabric 版則提供專屬的設定檔供修改。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">目前支援：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9&nbsp;| 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1354/228/bullshark-logo-gif.gif\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要其他版本的模組，或在 CurseForge 上遇到任何錯誤，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上追蹤我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
